    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 14:29:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年一会的年终总结播客&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《牧羊人》片段出自B站视频BV1nU4y1M7aw</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 从8月底开始讲起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a> 28岁读研到底会咋样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a>加入学生部门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a>我的课程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a>专业课遇到的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a>感觉是近十年读书最少的半年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a>下个学期的希冀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 我爱重庆 很有层次感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a>找工作压力真的很大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a>近期书影音推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a>《牧羊人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a>《老派约会之必要》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>朴实的希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 好好完成每一件事 认真对待每一个人 充实地过完每一天&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
