  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】9 你最看重朋友的什么特点？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a87930293471fed4f9c058</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a87930293471fed4f9c058</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Aug 2025 14:24:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客主要围绕两个话题展开：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 你最看重朋友的什么特点？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a>你认为最理想的幸福是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家留言给出自己的答案~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 最好的朋友是自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> 有趣就行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 大家都去贵州找方琴玩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 为什么感觉两个人单独待在一起会尴尬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 感觉我的答案有点自私</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 因为我没有被讨厌的勇气！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 以前什么都发真的很可爱很真实！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 你认为最理想的幸福是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 用物质上的富有去买一种清净、空闲和思考的空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 有想做的事情是一种珍贵的欲望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 做自己喜欢的事，做到让父母骄傲的程度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a>被讨厌的勇气竟成为我们播客的中心思想！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f6089cd1a5baad36ebdbee/lq9mXg9YzOk4ShV4NnP5Hnj9G803.m4a" length="31314506" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:16</itunes:duration>
