  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】8 十年前的高考生：我们的选择与遗憾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685d547bbef90978ec0f52b6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685d547bbef90978ec0f52b6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 14:14:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是久违的更新😉六月高考季，突然惊讶地发现高考离我们已经过去整整十年了。这场被视为人生中最重要的考试渐渐在记忆中模糊，现在的我们云淡风轻地再谈高考与大学生活，继续在不同的路上打怪升级……<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 回忆我们当时的高考<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 我们是怎么选专业的<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 回到大学想做什么 以及大学遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 夏天于我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 好消息！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 标准幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 不带手机上床挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 高考距离我们过去十年了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 从考试和成绩牢笼中出来后很自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 高考时心境很平和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">20:07</a> 没有归属感也是一种归属</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 我的高中是电视剧取景地！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 当年填志愿没有人指导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 很庆幸出省读的大学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 为什么选新闻专业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2020">33:40</a> 后知后觉的人生是“大器晚成”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 熬夜对记忆力的损伤haha（再次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 大学想做和后悔没做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2425">40:25</a> 只要想做全世界都会来帮你实现愿望！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 在英语俱乐部找到很多成就感</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f6089cd1a5baad36ebdbee/ltzTg7evIx7Sr4LtoWyQnAv0Vw66.m4a" length="45136836" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsySJpsdGSjd-iF-j1HQvKErRLGB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】7 今朝有酒今朝醉！再见2024！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67849381d6a4b57e14b533b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67849381d6a4b57e14b533b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 06:11:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔半年的更新！我们又集结聊年终总结啦！（喜迎中间的素材丢了一段所以话题有点跳跃）祝收听🐟块！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a>世界是一个巨大的草台班子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>祛（第一声）魅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a> 你怎么能对好吃的不感兴趣？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 第一是雪莹！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>泪洒现场，马上结婚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a>细心的男孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a>婚礼现场！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a>你是从哪一刻开始流泪的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a>你不求婚我们怎么订婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a>澄清：没有不想结婚，是因为不相信有人爱我觉得不可能结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a>你不是对人类感兴趣，你是对我感兴趣233</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>靠近三十岁的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a>我把人生当游戏一样玩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a> &nbsp;尖锐 是一个好词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a>我在解决生活中一个又一个的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a>年龄是一个数字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2799">46:39</a>食贫道（纯音乐替换其中30秒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a>二十岁的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3287">54:47</a>除了刀砍在身上，其他伤害都是自己加给自己的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3642">60:42</a>我成了薛定谔的猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">64:07</a>你就是自己的神！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4115">68:35</a>家人和爱的人是存活的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4261">71:01</a> 妈妈的衰老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4443">74:03</a>请你永远不要怀疑自己的魅力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4642">77:22</a>你对我不好 我会跑的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4745">79:05</a>职场喜迎在发光！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5238">87:18</a>今朝有酒今朝醉！新年请快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f6089cd1a5baad36ebdbee/lu-Yj_1T2IPy-v01trejgQOmnJE2.m4a" length="85256280" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsySJpsdGSjd-iF-j1HQvKErRLGB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】6 广东人的微辣？贵州人：请把这滴辣椒水滴我眼睛里！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667173e8c26e396a36ae283e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667173e8c26e396a36ae283e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 11:47:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久没更新啦，那就更一下吧^_^</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 又去贵阳啦 受欢迎的方方！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 天哪！竟然没有去你们没去过的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 我真的很爱吃米饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">08:37</a> 发朋友圈前要不要问问朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 把你发在我的朋友圈等于告诉所有人我的生活里有你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 广州高铁站可以送人送到座位上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">16:36</a> 地铁上看书的原因竟然是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 第一次有了下班有人等着你的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">20:50</a> 感觉自己长大了是真实的责任 不是一句鸡汤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 突然带货《动物农场》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 5月拿到了上班以来最高的一次工资˗ ˏ &nbsp;ˋ &nbsp;♡ &nbsp;ˎ &nbsp;ˊ &nbsp;&nbsp;˗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> 人是需要情绪价值的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 岳阳烧烤！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a>去贵州吃啥？酸汤牛肉 肠旺面……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 不能吃辣真的错过好多美食！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a>不能想象不辣的小龙虾是什么味道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2273">37:53</a> 这滴辣椒水滴下我眼睛里23333</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2480">41:20</a> 竟然会有舍不得的工作伙伴！真的很好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 兴义的风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> 孩子是一个“寄生物”出生后是“寄生”的延续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a> 巴太！巴太！！巴太！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> 《我在岛屿读书》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> UP:食贫道</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lseQQxl48AbeGaZ8yIP1ToLFSNkx.m4a" length="52917627" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsySJpsdGSjd-iF-j1HQvKErRLGB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】5 祝你自在，祝你勇敢，祝你妇女节快乐！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e9a5c82d96b6aa805fd24e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e9a5c82d96b6aa805fd24e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Mar 2024 11:32:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>国际劳动妇女节（International Working Women's Day，简写IWD）是纪念各国妇女百余年来争取和平、平等、发展的节日。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a>不是”女生节““女神节”“女王节”，是“国际劳动妇女节”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 最大的厌女症是女性的自我厌恶，这种时刻是解决厌女症，呼吁男女平等的开始。（上野千鹤子）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a>只要女性一方承担生育的角色，男女就永远不可能真正平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 反对女性“服美役”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 鼓励女性做自己想做的事 选择自己想过的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 我不是初出茅庐的小姑娘，请平等看待我和其他人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 女性从以前必须依附男性才能生存，到现在可以独立，社会已经前进了很多，我们是踏在以前千千万万的妇女的努力之上才获得今天的社会地位，我们感谢前辈，也很珍惜现在获得的机会。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 以前女性作为生育“工具人”的情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 男权社会的制度绵延了几千年，有时候我们被不平等对待，但并没有意识到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 男权社会中男性也受到一定的压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 男孩子也可以勇敢表达自己脆弱的一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 女性的晋升道路会相对辛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a>《伦敦生活》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 泰勒·斯威夫特（Taylor Swift）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a>《流俗地》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> 真的爱看余华的采访</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 是“少不读水浒 老不读三国”啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 《红楼梦》2010年版和1987版</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 更年期真是全世界最美好的事了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 女性的特征不能代表我们 少女感不是我们的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 有了微信这个通讯工具反而联系更少了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkKSKi3A6IXqj6jjSZAL9D9EtKvD.m4a" length="36358230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:28</itunes:duration>
