    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】4 年味消失？我们终于成长为制造年味的人了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e6b4afda891a9cd9df7150</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e6b4afda891a9cd9df7150</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 05:59:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>普通打工人开始了她们的2024年</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分为<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a>回顾近况、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 新年复工感受、 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 我们是怎么过年的三个部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>看手机是现代人避免尴尬的最好行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 早睡早起这件事一辈子都做不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a>我们来听个劲爆的消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 一眼帅一眼帅（重复）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 比婷婷还要夸张！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 新年复工感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 过年时快乐的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a>广东开工发红包很有人情味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> 这个很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 大家都是这么想的我就放心了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 上春山！（突然）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 我们从感受年味的人变成了制造年味的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 大家过年有没有给自己买新衣服？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 这一天是不同的 要做一些事让家人记得这个日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 元宵节“炸火狮”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lku2RMdDaRlYTpTwqmI3ff8gnvG9.m4a" length="41380165" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzeVNKcHNkR1NqZC1pRi1qMUhRdktFclJMR0IucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】3 啊！2023年就这样结束了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65955120926ad7aad071b20a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65955120926ad7aad071b20a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 12:20:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>普通打工人结束了她们的2023年</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期分为<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>2023年总结、<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a>2023年年度推荐和<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4310">71:50</a>2024年展望3个部分 还谈论了<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a>疫情前后的变化和对我们的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span>（时间有点赶剪辑较粗糙可能会有突然跳跃话题的感觉）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 钱都用来吃喝玩乐了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">03:05</a> 我最大的变化是不再会自己为难自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 不要列太多计划 马上去做就好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 公园二十分钟理论是真的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> 农村孩子长大后去到城市的感慨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 《俗女养成记》《黑暗荣耀》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a>《我的巴比伦恋人》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 我们要把自己放在第一位，而不是把世俗对我们的要求放在第一位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 亲子观察类综艺《爸爸当家》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a>《都市男女的爱情法则》让我出乎意料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a>《那些回不去的年少时光》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a>《杀死一只知更鸟》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 《莫斯科绅士》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> 《西南联大求学日记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">48:17</a> 鲁迅的日记真的很无聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a>《不方便但很幸福》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">54:24</a> 边炒菜颠勺时边看书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3527">58:47</a> 疫情对我个人影响不大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">61:10</a> 是不是疫情前的世界本来就是这样的，人们并没有疯狂呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3770">62:50</a> 疫情对我有产生影响，只是刚好在结束这一年回到计划轨道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4475">74:35</a> 督促自己多打电话给家人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4634">77:14</a> 我想多记录生活 快乐时光会像星星照亮灰暗的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">79:00</a> 不管事情变得有多糟，你仍然领先那些根本不想尝试的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4980">83:00</a> 这个世界就是很多元很复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5300">88:20</a> 多看点书吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5555">92:35</a> 下期预告</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq7JfcFCT4hCQKpVr_9ljbC7DS68.m4a" length="90799205" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:33:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzeVNKcHNkR1NqZC1pRi1qMUhRdktFclJMR0IucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】2 等什么？走啊！去看山观海见朋友</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65719e76d6e0ff5822d534bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65719e76d6e0ff5822d534bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Dec 2023 10:29:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>普通打工人分享工作间隙的旅行经历和感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 喜欢北方还是南方？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 理性的山和感性的海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 香格里拉让我长途跋涉去到最后高反躺了两天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 和朋友一起旅行很舒服很安心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 独自旅行是作为“游离者”与城市对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 陵水酸粉！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 你一个湖南人竟然没去过张家界？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 活可以一直干，看火箭发射能有几回！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 看海上落日是时间具象化的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 吓得我那晚连发三条朋友圈证明我不是无聊的大人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a>看到那个场景我觉得一切等待都值得了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2810">46:50</a>改变生活态度 在熟悉的地方也会像旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 人是由猿进化而来的 就要在没有天花板的地方生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">58:20</a>大家都是成年人 有话就说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3830">63:50</a> 千万别被人扣手心 不然就被留在泸沽湖了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4103">68:23</a> 这辈子还是有机会的！只要你想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4134">68:54</a> 难道我不读北大是因为我不想吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4287">71:27</a> 险！算我命大</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsc-oLqyMUvJTgv_Ku2DwkAE8Szp.m4a" length="74315690" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZsYlk3OUFFME5TdEtxTDB3NWM1OWl1QVFVMTYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【刚刚下班】1 我们为什么做播客？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656c797a8fb8b597a227a13a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656c797a8fb8b597a227a13a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Dec 2023 12:50:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 我们为什么想做播客？</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 说清楚，是荷兰还是河南？</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 那个时刻让我觉得播客很有意思</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 播客和短视频对我们注意力掠夺的不同</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 我们打算做怎样的播客？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1605">26:45</a> 守规矩是非常坏的 叛逆起来吧！</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1887">31:27</a> 就是没有答案才有“聊头”</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 世俗的成功人生必须每一步都在该走的脚印上</span></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llnraXoPa41_dpOdDlraWinsfcWi.m4a" length="14190547" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:21</itunes:duration>
